---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="Dinepod brings people together through food, chefs and unforgettable experiences.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#f4efe5"><title>Dinepod — Good food. Better together.</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;1,500;1,600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
<header><a class="logo" href="#top">dinepod<span>.</span></a><nav><a href="#story">Our thought</a><a href="#chefs">Chefs</a><a href="#experiences">Experiences</a><a href="#stories">Stories</a></nav><a class="toplink" href="#hello">Come hungry ↗</a></header>
<main id="top">
<section class="hero"><div class="copy"><p class="eyebrow">✳ &nbsp; A seat at the table, wherever you are</p><h1>Good food.<br><em>Better together.</em></h1><p class="intro">The best things happen around a table. Discover the people, flavours and little moments that make a meal memorable.</p><a class="under" href="#story">A little about us ↘</a></div><div class="heroimg"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547592180-85f173990554?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85" alt="A generous table of colourful food"><span class="caption">01 / 04 &nbsp; Made for sharing</span><span class="stamp">GOOD FOOD<br>GOOD PEOPLE<br>✳<br>GOOD TIMES</span></div><small class="foot">FOOD IS A LOVE LANGUAGE. ALWAYS HAS BEEN.</small></section>
<section class="manifesto" id="story"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE DINEPOD THOUGHT</p><small>A note on gathering</small></div><div><h2>A little less ordinary.<br><em>A lot more human.</em></h2><div class="manifesto-bottom"><p>We believe food is about more than what's on the plate. It's the stories passed around, the recipes remembered, the strangers who become friends and the feeling of being right where you belong.</p><i>Pull up a chair.</i></div></div></section>
<section class="chefs section" id="chefs"><div class="sectionhead"><div><p class="eyebrow">THE PEOPLE BEHIND THE PLATE</p><h2>Good food starts<br><em>with good people.</em></h2></div><p>A taste of the talent, character<br>and stories behind every meal.</p></div><div class="cards"><article><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1577219491135-ce391730fb2c?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="Chef preparing a dish"><small>01 — THE CRAFT</small></article><article class="offset"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1556911220-e15b29be8c8f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="Cook preparing ingredients"><small>02 — THE HOME</small></article><article><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574969903809-3f7a166a4b13?auto=format&fit=crop&w=900&q=85" alt="Chef plating a meal"><small>03 — THE DETAIL</small></article></div><p class="note">A growing table of cooks, makers and hosts. <em>More introductions soon ✳</em></p></section>
<section class="experience" id="experiences"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517248135467-4c7edcad34c4?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1500&q=85" alt="Warm dining room"><div><p class="eyebrow">MORE THAN A MEAL</p><h2>Make room for<br><em>something memorable.</em></h2><p>From intimate dinners to lively gatherings, the best experiences begin with good food and an open seat.</p><b>GATHER &nbsp; AROUND<br>THE TABLE ✳</b></div></section>
<section class="stories section" id="stories"><div class="sectionhead"><div><p class="eyebrow">NOTES FROM THE TABLE</p><h2>Stories worth<br><em>passing around.</em></h2></div><p>Food, culture, memory and all<br>the good things in between.</p></div><div class="storycards"><article><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1547592180-85f173990554?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Colourful food"><small>THE ART OF GATHERING</small><h3>Why we gather</h3><p>Sometimes the simplest thing — sharing a meal — is the whole point.</p></article><article><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1555939594-58d7cb561ad1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Food cooking over flame"><small>FROM THE KITCHEN</small><h3>Recipes have roots</h3><p>Every dish carries a little piece of somewhere, and someone.</p></article><article><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1528605248644-14dd04022da1?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=85" alt="Friends sharing a meal"><small>PEOPLE & PLACES</small><h3>The more, the merrier</h3><p>There's always room for one more at a table made for sharing.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="closing" id="hello"><p class="eyebrow">THERE'S A PLACE FOR YOU HERE</p><h2>Come as you are.<br><em>Leave a little fuller.</em></h2><small>DINEPOD — GOOD FOOD, BETTER TOGETHER.</small></section>
</main><footer><a class="logo" href="#top">dinepod<span>.</span></a><p>Food is better when it brings us together.</p><small>© {year} Dinepod</small></footer>
</body>
</html>
<style>
:root{--paper:#f4efe5;--deep:#e9e1d3;--ink:#292820;--muted:#777568;--red:#bd573c;--olive:#747b56}*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}body{margin:0;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}header{height:86px;padding:0 7%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d1c3}.logo{font:600 34px "Playfair Display",serif;letter-spacing:-2px}.logo span{color:var(--red)}nav{display:flex;gap:32px}nav a,.toplink{font-size:11px;color:#555448}.toplink{border-bottom:1px solid var(--red);padding-bottom:7px}.hero{min-height:680px;padding:85px 9% 75px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:7%;align-items:center;position:relative}.eyebrow{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:700;color:var(--red)}h1,h2,h3{font-family:"Playfair Display",serif;font-weight:500}h1{font-size:clamp(60px,7.5vw,100px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-4px;margin:25px 0}h1 em,h2 em{color:var(--red);font-weight:500}.intro{max-width:365px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:30px}.under{font-size:11px;font-weight:600;border-bottom:1px solid var(--red);padding-bottom:8px}.heroimg{height:480px;position:relative}.heroimg>img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;border-radius:48% 48% 2px 2px}.caption{position:absolute;bottom:18px;left:18px;background:var(--paper);padding:12px;font:italic 14px "Playfair Display"}.stamp{position:absolute;right:-32px;top:25px;background:var(--olive);color:white;border-radius:50%;width:108px;height:108px;display:grid;place-content:center;text-align:center;font-size:9px;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:1px;transform:rotate(9deg)}.foot{position:absolute;bottom:25px;left:9%;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#999182}.manifesto{background:var(--deep);padding:90px 12%;display:grid;grid-template-columns:.6fr 1.4fr;gap:6%}.manifesto small{color:var(--muted);font:italic 14px "Playfair Display"}.manifesto h2,.sectionhead h2,.experience h2,.closing h2{font-size:clamp(40px,5vw,65px);line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-2px;margin:0}.manifesto-bottom{display:flex;align-items:end;gap:35px;margin-top:25px}.manifesto-bottom p,.experience div>p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:470px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted)}.manifesto-bottom i{font:italic 20px "Playfair Display";color:var(--red);white-space:nowrap}.section{padding:105px 10%}.sectionhead{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:45px}.sectionhead>p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}.cards,.storycards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px}.cards article img{width:100%;height:300px;object-fit:cover;display:block}.cards small,.storycards small{display:block;margin-top:13px;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#817c6f}.cards .offset{margin-top:55px}.note{text-align:center;font:italic 15px "Playfair Display";color:var(--muted);margin-top:45px}.note em{color:var(--red)}.experience{background:var(--olive);color:var(--paper);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;min-height:540px}.experience>img{width:100%;height:100%;min-height:540px;object-fit:cover}.experience>div{padding:75px 10%;align-self:center}.experience .eyebrow{color:#e7c99b}.experience h2{font-size:clamp(38px,4.5vw,58px);margin:20px 0}.experience h2 em{color:#f0d0a5}.experience div>p:not(.eyebrow){color:#e3e0d2}.experience b{display:block;margin-top:45px;font:italic 27px/1.1 "Playfair Display";color:#ead7b2;transform:rotate(-5deg)}.stories{background:#eee8dc}.storycards article img{width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover}.storycards h3{font-size:25px;margin:9px 0}.storycards article>p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted)}.closing{text-align:center;background:#ddc9aa;padding:90px 20px;position:relative}.closing h2{font-size:clamp(44px,6vw,72px);margin:18px 0 28px}.closing small{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:2px;color:#77705f}footer{background:#292a22;color:var(--paper);padding:32px 7%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}footer p{font:italic 14px "Playfair Display";color:#c9c3b5}footer small{font-size:9px;color:#aaa595}@media(max-width:700px){header{height:72px;padding:0 5%}.logo{font-size:29px}nav{gap:13px}nav a{font-size:9px}nav a:first-child,.toplink{display:none}.hero{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch;padding:60px 7% 70px;gap:35px}h1{font-size:clamp(62px,14vw,86px)}.heroimg{height:370px;width:88%;align-self:flex-end}.stamp{right:-25px;width:94px;height:94px;font-size:8px}.foot{left:7%}.manifesto{display:block;padding:65px 8%}.manifesto>div:first-child{margin-bottom:30px}.manifesto-bottom{display:block}.manifesto-bottom i{display:block;margin-top:20px}.section{padding:75px 7%}.sectionhead{display:block}.sectionhead>p{margin-top:18px}.cards{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px}.cards article:first-child{grid-column:1/-1}.cards article img{height:230px}.cards article:first-child img{height:300px}.cards .offset{margin-top:0}.note{font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}.experience{grid-template-columns:1fr}.experience>img{height:290px;min-height:290px}.experience>div{padding:55px 8% 65px}.storycards{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:32px}.storycards article img{height:250px}footer{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px}footer p{order:3;width:100%;margin:0}}
</style>